
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Results Unavailable | St. Columbus Public School</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#4a291d">

  <style>
    :root {
      --brown: #4a291d;
      --brown-dark: #30190f;
      --brown-light: #80543b;
      --gold: #d9a94f;
      --gold-light: #f0d5a1;
      --cream: #fbf5ee;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #392319;
      --muted: #8b7465;
      --border: #e5c5a8;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 35px 18px;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);

      background-color: #c49a79;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(135deg, #fffaf5 25%, transparent 25%),
        linear-gradient(225deg, #fffaf5 25%, transparent 25%),
        linear-gradient(315deg, #ead5c3 25%, transparent 25%),
        linear-gradient(45deg, #ead5c3 25%, transparent 25%);
      background-size: 72px 40px;
      background-position:
        0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 0;
    }

    .page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 700px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--gold-light);
      border-radius: 19px;
      box-shadow: 0 22px 55px rgba(58, 30, 17, 0.20);
      animation: appear 0.5s ease-out;
    }

    .top-line {
      height: 5px;
      background: linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        var(--brown-dark),
        var(--gold),
        var(--brown)
      );
    }

    .school-header {
      padding: 30px 25px 25px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #f9f0e7,
        #fffdfb,
        #f7ede3
      );
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .school-logo {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      object-fit: contain;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .school-name {
      color: var(--brown);
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(23px, 4vw, 34px);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .school-address {
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: #a56b3b;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 35px 32px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(247, 237, 227, 0.22) 25%,
          transparent 25%
        );
    }

    .status-icon {
      width: 86px;
      height: 86px;
      margin: 0 auto 23px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold-light);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--brown);
    }

    .status-icon svg {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 1.7;
      fill: none;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .status-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 9px 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e7c58e;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: #fff6e6;
      color: #865328;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: var(--brown);
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(27px, 4.5vw, 35px);
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .description {
      max-width: 490px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffaf5, #fdf6ed);
      text-align: left;
    }

    .notice-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
      color: var(--brown);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .notice-mark {
      width: 27px;
      height: 27px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: var(--brown);
      color: var(--gold-light);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .notice p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .button {
      min-height: 47px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 9px;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s,
                  transform 0.2s;
    }

    .button-primary {
      border-color: var(--brown);
      background: linear-gradient(
        110deg,
        var(--brown),
        var(--brown-dark)
      );
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 7px 16px rgba(74, 41, 29, 0.15);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      background: #68402d;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .button-secondary {
      background: #fffdfb;
      color: var(--brown);
    }

    .button-secondary:hover {
      background: #f8eee4;
    }

    .button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--gold);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 20px 15px;
      border-top: 1px solid #f0dfd0;
      background: #fdf8f2;
      color: #9b8473;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .footer strong {
      color: var(--brown);
    }

    @keyframes appear {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(12px);
      }

      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      body {
        padding: 18px 12px;
      }

      .page {
        border-radius: 14px;
      }

      .school-header {
        padding: 25px 15px 22px;
      }

      .school-logo {
        width: 65px;
        height: 65px;
      }

      .school-name {
        font-size: clamp(19px, 5vw, 25px);
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      }

      .school-address {
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 30px 20px 24px;
      }

      .status-icon {
        width: 74px;
        height: 74px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      .description {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .notice {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .actions {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .button {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">

    <div class="top-line"></div>

    <header class="school-header">

      <!-- Replace with your actual school logo path -->
      <img
        class="school-logo"
        src="/images/school-logo.png"
        alt="St. Columbus Public School logo"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      >

      <div class="school-name">
        St. Columbus Public School
      </div>

      <div class="school-address">
        Ekdara, Jhajha, Jamui, Bihar
      </div>

    </header>

    <section class="content">

      <div class="status-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="11" rx="2"></rect>
          <path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"></path>
          <path d="M12 14v3"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="status-badge">
        Result Portal Temporarily Closed
      </div>

      <h1>Online Result<br>Showcasing Is Off</h1>

      <p class="description">
        The online student result facility is currently unavailable.
        We appreciate your patience and understanding.
        Please check with the school office for further assistance.
      </p>

      <div class="notice">
        <div class="notice-title">
          <span class="notice-mark" aria-hidden="true">i</span>
          Need Help With Your Child's Result?
        </div>

        <p>
          Parents and students may contact the school office for
          result-related queries, academic updates, and further
          information.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">

        <a
          class="button button-primary"
          href="https://www.stcolumbusekdara.cloud/"
        >
          VISIT OFFICIAL WEBSITE
        </a>

        <a
          class="button button-secondary"
          href="javascript:history.back()"
        >
          GO BACK
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      <strong>ST. COLUMBUS PUBLIC SCHOOL</strong><br>
      Ekdara, Jhajha, Jamui, Bihar<br>
      &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
      All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
